<title>USA: NYSE pre-closing order imbalances.</title>
<headline>NYSE pre-closing order imbalances.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange reported the following pre-closing order imbalances:</p>
<p>PEP, sell, 50,800</p>
<p>IBM, sell, 64,400</p>
<p>BLS, buy, 50,700</p>
<p>CHV, buy, 62,000</p>
